etless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q_wPf5kf1vgQ7kNvwEGRv-S&_nc_oc=AdrjgyTIBlJXTmR4cGpmjpvUVrvq5WGQ9sMt9Lgp0XIPH_qp2aojJU3dGxsOy--BlBI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTL2NgGeQuH8f-fSk-nv2GPmqyoltH0VEZb0WEoHAq5GA&oe=6AFB33C4"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_5.png", "id": "1791313565142796", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604360590_1791313568476129_3703751038914379489_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8GxwEmgG81kQ7kNvwGsLj4-&_nc_oc=AdprAOeUH5uu3w0Com_Be8LUBldwU2xEQYzNUP2okQSlCW8YN0wyYJ6mhVKaDQSdXUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTyvjlsJADE8a_08XDFOAintTxsqQm7YAwjbc5TT79URA&oe=6AFB2750"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_cover.png", "id": "2975944199408785", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673525341_2975944206075451_4893382561558365663_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GPO10y-Le6gQ7kNvwEzxalm&_nc_oc=Adr3YimOiLKzToXs9YpS2JO10R-dG7y8w0KkrEblYJloLsanu2GzTtMlUntYiU-RYlI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRcerr00OCssR5GDPViPlMm9umW7L6iaV9hIyUeig0ttw&oe=6AFB4039"}, "display_name": "Flight Simulator Manchester", "keywords": ["flight", "simulator", "manchester", "jet", "pilot"], "long_description": "Flight Simulator Manchester puts you in the captain's seat over the real North West of England.\n\nTHE REAL MANCHESTER\nReal satellite, elevation and map data: the Town Hall, the Beetham Tower, Deansgate Square, the Etihad, Old Trafford, the Lowry and MediaCityUK, the Trafford Centre, the Stockport viaduct, Jodrell Bank's dish and the Pennine moors.\n\nLIVERPOOL, BLACKPOOL AND THE COAST\nThe Royal Liver Building, both cathedrals, Anfield, Goodison and Everton's new stadium, the Albert Dock, Crosby's iron men, Southport's pier, Blackpool Tower and the Pleasure Beach.\n\nFLY THROUGH THE RUNCORN ARCH\nLow down the Mersey, over the Mersey Gateway and through the steel arch of the Silver Jubilee Bridge.\n\nA LIVING CITY\nTrams and trains on their real tracks, the Mersey ferries, hundreds of real wind turbines turning. At night the stadiums and Blackpool's Illuminations light up.\n\nAIR TRAFFIC CONTROL\nTaxi and takeoff clearances and your landing clearance.\n\nYOUR GLASS HANGAR\nEvery flight starts in your glass hangar on Dock 9 at Salford Quays, Deansgate Square out of the doors. Walk around, repaint, wash, fly.\n\nFOUR AIRCRAFT\nTwo private jets with walk-through cabins, a midsize jet and a fighter.\n\nELEVEN MISSIONS\nThe city approach, the Mersey approach, a hop to Blackpool, the Ship Canal run, the Runcorn arch, a Warton scramble, the coast, Manchester by night and a city tour.\n\nFLY TOGETHER ONLINE\nQuick Match or a private sky with a code. Voice chat stays off until you turn it on.", "short_description": "Fly the real Manchester, built from real satellite and map data: the Town Hall, the Beetham Tower, Deansgate Square, Old Trafford, the Etihad, Salford Quays - and on to Liverpool's Three Graces, Anfield and Blackpool Tower. Start in your own glass hangar on Dock 9 at the Quays, talk to air traffic control, fly through the Runcorn arch and land at Manchester, Liverpool, Warton and Blackpool."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/flightsimulatormanchester/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Citiview Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/flightsimulatormanchester/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "N